{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32261","headline":"题裴晋公林亭 · 温庭筠","name":"题裴晋公林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢傅林亭暑气微，山丘零落閟音徽。\n东山终爲苍生起，南浦虚言白首归。\n池凤已传春水浴，渚禽犹带夕阳飞。\n悠然到此忘情处，一日何妨有万几。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}